        "role": "user",
        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"4adab310-fa69-4ad0-8176-f80090f4db04\",\"review_text\":\"Super app and super service, helped solve the login issue with the main account, thanks.\"},{\"review_id\":\"4dcb7cb0-b799-482a-89fe-956229f7cb99\",\"review_text\":\"I absolutely love this app\"},{\"review_id\":\"95bbd835-c9a7-421d-9141-1f9c704b09a3\",\"review_text\":\"You all have made it clear that there will be ads. Can you please be a bit more sensitive to the content you are interrupting when you place all those many many ads?\"},{\"review_id\":\"0a5b9887-2489-4554-8c3f-97c1d0b6c508\",\"review_text\":\"Very nice♥️\"},{\"review_id\":\"bcfce49b-6e57-4dd1-a552-c480c32fc2b9\",\"review_text\":\"The best music. Never let's me down...\"},{\"review_id\":\"970c0c05-73d1-4dd6-8df7-750e1be69c62\",\"review_text\":\"You burn our Quran so we sell your app and all stuff\"},{\"review_id\":\"c43e2e6d-730a-4347-86a3-f151fe9b8a82\",\"review_text\":\"I illl yous is aapfriest time\"},{\"review_id\":\"b9c5c482-cf7b-4a97-b738-616fd9163667\",\"review_text\":\"That's great\"},{\"review_id\":\"a954426d-208f-4c3f-ae3f-029462d70919\",\"review_text\":\"You need the complete Judge Dredd and Cliffhanger soundtracks\"},{\"review_id\":\"2928d178-a338-496d-8f4c-5941a52329d8\",\"review_text\":\"I'm really tired of spotify getting rid of the option to listen to snippets of songs. How else am I supposed to find out what songs I would like to try listening to for the first time when all I have is the title and nothing else? Its ridiculous and absolutely nobody asked for this update. Please stop adding stupid stuff and removing the features that are actually useful.\"}]}"
